  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.31\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.31 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.30\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.30 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.29\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.29 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.28\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.28 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.27\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.27 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.26\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.26 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.25\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.25 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.24\n- Renamed the shipped JavaScript modules to fireForNet-remoteconfig-indexeddb-shared.js and fireForNet-remoteconfig-visibility-browser.js, matching the module names the Blazor package binds them to.\n- The IndexedDB module now has a physical copy in this package's own wwwroot. It previously had none at all: the module was only linked from the Blazor package, and the link resolved its content root to the linking project, so the module 404ed at runtime.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.23\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.23 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.22\n- Metadata persistence stores RemoteConfigMetadata directly with FetchStatus wire strings; unknown persisted status strings now fail loudly (previously fell back to NoFetchYet).\n\nv1.0.1-preview.21\n- No functional changes; synchronized with the framework-free MAUI integration sweep.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.20\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.20 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.19\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.19 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.18\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.18 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.17\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.17 release.\n- Initial release.\n- [JSImport]-based IndexedDB and localStorage persistence for Remote Config containers, settings, and metadata.\n- CORS-safe Remote Config request header interceptor.\n- Tab-visibility lifecycle monitor for the realtime stream.\n- Framework-independent WASM (Uno Platform, Avalonia WASM, pure .NET WASM).\n- IndexedDB-primary store with localStorage fallback when IndexedDB is unavailable or security-blocked.\n- Chains Installations.Browser.UseBrowser() when the installation store is the in-memory default.",
